  "description": "This solid salad is bursting with all the colours, flavours and textures. From the sweet and juicy cherry tomatoes, crisp baby broccoli\nand peppery rocket, to the crunchy ciabatta croutons, creamy pesto and sharp Parmesan, every bite is different - and delightful!\nThis recipe is under 650kcal per serving.\nThe recent wet weather conditions across the East Coast have impacted our regular supply of fresh ingredients and as such what you receive may be slightly different to what’s pictured. Don’t worry, your recipe will be just as delicious!",
