  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Halve the cherry/snacking tomatoes. Thickly slice the carrot and zucchini into half-moons. Thickly slice the red onion into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b96df10db0c84a862bacc1/step-c21e3041.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place the prepped veggies on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with 1/2 the garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt. Toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b96df10db0c84a862bacc1/step-196b8023.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, cut or tear the bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks. Place on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with the remaining garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b96df10db0c84a862bacc1/step-ed919e52.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Bake the croutons until golden, 5-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b96df10db0c84a862bacc1/step-ccb03ca4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the roast veggies have cooled slightly, add the rocket leaves, croutons and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar to the oven tray and gently toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b96df10db0c84a862bacc1/step-b9af08cb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the roast veggie and garlic crouton salad between bowls. Sprinkle with the slivered almonds. Dollop the creamy pesto dressing over the salad. Serve topped with the grated Parmesan cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b96df10db0c84a862bacc1/step-27754a0a.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
